[
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;; :mm/Artifact — Abstract Supertype for Durable Output Memorials
;;
;; Per:
;;   - memory/types/artifact.md (corpus self-description)
;;   - decisions/sandbar_memorial_type_substrate_layering_2026_05_21.md (D2)
;;   - decisions/substrate_class_catalog_maximally_expressive_opt_in_overrideable_2026_05_21.md (maximally-expressive principle)
;;   - decisions/sandbar_memorial_type_ontology_corrections_round_c_2026_05_21.md (R5 final taxonomy + R2 4-level inheritance Reference→{Resource, ContentType})
;;
;; CONCRETE SUBTYPES (12, declared in this file):
;;   - :mm/Decision   (ADR; no type-specific slots — body sections + frontmatter inherited)
;;   - :mm/Plan       (design document + arc memorial; 8 slots)
;;   - :mm/Log        (chronological session record; 7 slots; handoff-schema-version + closed-at + host)
;;   - :mm/Example    (reusable illustration; 3 slots; demonstrates: typed-edge already substrate)
;;   - :mm/Briefing   (audience-targeted explainer; 3 slots: audience + occasion + presented-on)
;;   - :mm/Library    (deep external-library study; Library-Card axes already substrate-side typed-edges)
;;   - :mm/Reference  (external-facility pointer; CONCRETE; has sub-subtypes Resource + ContentType)
;;       ├── :mm/Resource    (URL pointer; 8 slots; url + accessed + ...)
;;       └── :mm/ContentType (format/purpose axis; 7 slots; mime XOR kind — single-axis discipline)
;;   - :mm/Memoir     (process record; 5 slots; methodology + provenance + sanitization-log)
;;   - :mm/Codebase   (code repo; 4 slots beyond has-meta-type; declares has-meta-type :mm/CodeMetaType)
;;   - :mm/Synthesis  (derived claim ≥ 3 citations; 1 slot: claim; cites already substrate)
;;
;; INHERITANCE: :mm/Artifact :dt/subclass-of :mm/Memory.  Concrete subtypes :dt/subclass-of :mm/Artifact.
;; Reference→Resource and Reference→ContentType form 4-level inheritance chains (Memory → Artifact → Reference → {Resource, ContentType}).
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;

