 [{:db/ident         :mm/Artifact
   :dt/type          :dt/Class
   :dt/subclass-of   :mm/Memory
   :dt/context       "mm"
   :dt/label         "Artifact"
   :dt/abstract?     true
   :db/doc "Abstract supertype for memorial types whose role is producing durable, self-contained outputs with memorial value beyond their immediate trigger.  Per memory/types/artifact.md.  Concrete subtypes: :mm/Decision (ADR), :mm/Plan (design document + arc memorial), :mm/Log (session record), :mm/Example (reusable illustration), :mm/Briefing (audience-targeted explainer), :mm/Library (deep external-library study), :mm/Reference (external-facility pointer; sub-subtypes :mm/Resource + :mm/ContentType), :mm/Memoir (process-record), :mm/Codebase (source-code repo), :mm/Synthesis (derived claim across citations).  Per decisions/sandbar_memorial_type_substrate_layering_2026_05_21.md D2 + decisions/sandbar_memorial_type_ontology_corrections_round_c_2026_05_21.md R5.  Not instantiated directly."}]

